export function virtueBit(bit,label,branch='PASS'){
 if(![0,1].includes(bit)||!['good','evil','unknown'].includes(label)||!['PASS','FAIL'].includes(branch))throw Error('Invalid hold/flip input');
 return label==='evil'?bit^1:bit;
}
export function particleState(seed=1,count=48){
 if(!Number.isInteger(seed)||!Number.isInteger(count)||count<1||count>48)throw Error('Invalid seed or count');
 const s={rng:seed>>>0||1,tick:0,branch:'PASS',review:true,prayerHash:0,particles:[]};
 for(let i=0;i<count;i++)s.particles.push({x:particleRandom(s)%4096,y:particleRandom(s)%4096,vx:0,vy:0,raw:0,prayer:0,proposed:0,output:0,label:'unknown'});
 return s;
}
export function particleRandom(s){let x=s.rng;x^=x<<13;x^=x>>>17;x^=x<<5;s.rng=x>>>0;return s.rng;}
